        <p class="pex">Claim. I took every xn-- registrable domain in a pinned Tranco list (1,425 domains), decoded each to Unicode and made 8 variants of it that a user could plausibly type: as is, uppercase, fullwidth, U+3002 dots, U+FF0E dots, NFD, mixed case …</p>
