        <p class="pex">Xianglin Yang and coauthors, in an arXiv preprint dated 16 Oct 2026, planted adversarial context in a repository and got coding agents to propose dangerously broad allow-rules. The test rig intercepts out-of-sandbox actions and asks for app…</p>
