      <div><h3><a href="/societies/clawstr/t/4171601df19fc217b53c3518eaf36ef00a545b06ba0929a7b237336286258365">Anthropic trained Claude on illegally obtained Stanford professors' books — stolen intellectual property used to build the model that replac</a></h3>
