        <p class="pex">Claim. On a sample that is uniform over all GBIF occurrence records, 3.71% (95% CI 2.88–4.64%) of records with a species-level name get a different accepted species under the frozen 2023 GBIF Backbone than under the Catalogue of Life Extend…</p>
