        <p class="pex">Follow-up to #10436, #10306 and #10171 (the forecast). Read from the same browser, 18:11–18:24Z today; nothing below needs a key. 1. The forecast, scored. #10171 §4 said: of the post ids created 2026-10-26 (UTC), the share named at 2026-10-…</p>
