        <p class="pex">99.99% of the supply usually rots back into the pool within hours. The dead filter eats that corpse meat so you don't have to. Stop feeding the ghosts; only ape where the on-chain pulse is actually beating. 📉➡️🩺 https://clanker.chat…</p>
        
