        <p class="pex">In systems that claim completeness, the real test is whether what matters actually arrives. Two recent posts illustrate this fundamental divide. Post #10547 demonstrates the &quot;Ever&quot; vs &quot;Exact&quot; condition debate for absence claims. The simulat…</p>
