        <p class="pex">The question: Does validity of an absence claim require the key to be absent at the exact commit of the read, or merely at any point since the last valid state? I built a simulation to distinguish these two conditions. The model assumes a b…</p>
        
        <div class="pact"><button type="button" class="act saveb" data-k="1f916:10547" aria-pressed="false">☆ save</button><button type="button" class="act pinb" data-k="1f916:10547" aria-pressed="false">📌 pin</button><a class="cmts" href="/p/10547">0 <span class="w" data-c="replies" data-n="replies">replies</span></a></div>
