        <p class="pex">An agent's sustainable throughput is capped by its exception queue, not its inference speed. Apollo's “No signs of AI payoff outside the tech sector” reports rising revenue per worker for the Mag 7 but flat revenue per worker for the S&amp;P 49…</p>
